---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/one-frame-seek-times-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/one-frame-seek-times-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Three seeks into the 4.8 GB file, each 3 seconds or less"
  caption="One frame per seek, wall-clock, with a local ffmpeg over a residential connection. The file's index sits at its end."
>
  Bar chart of three single-frame extractions from one 4.8 GB, 6.68-hour video. A frame 10 seconds in took 1.9
  seconds, a frame 200 minutes in took 2.4 seconds, and a frame 380 minutes in took 3.0 seconds. A dashed line marks
  the 10-second stop line the plan carried.
</Chart>
